WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:07.150
 I have always
felt, if you know

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:11.230
what you're going to do in
advance, then you won't do it.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.760
Your creativity starts with
whether you're curious or not.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.606
Roll 'em.

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:24.181
Go.

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:24.680
Action.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.070
When you build a
building-- any building--

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:37.170
start with a simple block
model to see where that goes.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.400
Most of our cities are built
with just faceless glass,

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.700
only for economies and
not for humanities.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.160
As an artist, I got constraints.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:51.360
Gravity is one of them.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.460
But within all
those constraints,

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:59.090
I have 15% of freedom
to make my art.

00:01:04.315 --> 00:01:09.400
I'm always trying
to express movement.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:13.810
I was fascinated with the fold,
so basic to our first feelings

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.440
of love and warmth.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:21.390
These ideas are scary as
hell to tell to the client.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.330
They can reject
you, and they will.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:27.460
But you've got to
find your own voice.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:30.073
Create the logic
for it as you go.

00:01:30.073 --> 00:01:32.590
Stretch it into another place.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.470
I'm just telling you how
I did it and why I did it.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:42.740
Whatever you do, promise me
that every project you make

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:46.226
or design, you'll take the
risk of doing something

00:01:46.226 --> 00:01:50.210
for humanity.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:55.190
I'm Frank Gehry, and
this is my Masterclass.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.940
You would think I'd
know when to quit.

